<title>USA: Alliance amends credit agreements.</title>
<headline>Alliance amends credit agreements.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Entertainment Corp said on Monday that it has amended a credit agreement that waived covenant defaults as of December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The amended credit agreement requires that the company raise $35 million in equity by July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Alliance said it is studying its financing alternatives to raise the equity and additional funds to complete its consolidation program, which is estimated at $20 million.</p>
</text>
